ers and nearby printing.","source_url":"https://lits.mtholyoke.edu/places/study-spaces","source_title":"Study spaces | LITS","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The LCC lounge is additionally open whenever Ciruti Language Center is open.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kendade-atrium","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Marion Craig Potter ’49 Atrium","title":"Pause or work in the Kendade atrium","subtitle":"Kendade Hall, Science Center","notes":"Use the atrium for a study break, a conversation with friends or group-project time as you move through the Science Center complex.","short_summary":"A central science-building atrium designed for studying and informal time with friends.","evidence_claim":"Mount Holyoke describes the Kendade atrium as a space to study or hang out with friends and notes circular rooms for group projects.","source_url":"https://www.mtholyoke.edu/academics/centers-and-facilities/science-center","source_title":"Science Center | Mount Holyoke College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Part of Kendade Hall in the Science Center complex.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"blanchard-hall","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Blanchard Hall","title":"Use Blanchard Hall as a campus meeting point","subtitle":"Community Center","notes":"Meet up in the central atrium or choose its informal seating when you want to socialize, study or connect with Student Life services.","short_summary":"A three-level community hub with informal social and study spaces.","evidence_claim":"Mount Holyoke describes Blanchard Hall’s entry level as the campus living room, with informal spaces for socializing and study.","source_url":"https://embark.mtholyoke.edu/community