center/blanchard/","source_title":"Blanchard Hall | Mount Holyoke College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The building also houses Student Life services; some rooms and activities may require reservation.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"beverly-daniel-tatum-unity-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Beverly Daniel Tatum Unity Center","title":"Gather at the Unity Center","subtitle":"Room 206, Blanchard Hall","notes":"Attend an Intergroup Dialogue, connect with an affiliated student group or use the space for a conversation that welcomes differing experiences.","short_summary":"A Blanchard gathering space supporting dialogue, student organizations and community connection.","evidence_claim":"The Unity Center hosts most Intergroup Dialogues and is home to several student groups and peer-education programs.","source_url":"https://www.mtholyoke.edu/student-experience/community-and-belonging/cultural-centers/unity-center","source_title":"Unity Center | Mount Holyoke College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located at 206 Blanchard Hall; programming and access vary by activity.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fimbel-maker-innovation-lab","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Fimbel Maker & Innovation Lab","title":"Make a project in the Fimbel Lab","subtitle":"Prospect Hall","notes":"Bring an academic or personal project, then use the lab’s tools and staff support to prototype, build or learn alongside other makers.","short_summary":"An 8,000-square-foot makerspace for projects, workshops and interdisciplinary collaboration.","evidence_claim":"The Fimbel Lab is open to the Mount Holyoke community for academic and personal projects and provides tools, people and resources for maker culture.","source_url":"https://www.mtholyoke.edu/academics/centers-and-facilities/fimbel-maker-innovation-lab","source_title":"Fimbel Maker & Innovation Lab | Mount Holyoke College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open to the Mount Holyoke community, including Five College students taking Mount Holyoke classes; academic projects receive priority.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"talcott-greenhouse","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Talcott Greenhouse","title":"Visit the living collection at Talcott Greenhouse","subtitle":"Mount Holyoke College Botanic Garden","notes":"Walk through the greenhouse collection to observe plants from different climates, or use a casual visit as a reset during a campus day.","short_summary":"A teaching greenhouse with tropical, subtropical and other non-hardy plants.","evidence_claim":"Talcott Greenhouse houses the Botanic Garden’s non-hardy plant collection and supports teaching across academic departments and programs.","source_url":"https://www.mtholyoke.edu/directory/departments-offices-centers/botanic-garden/talcott-greenhouse","source_title":"Talcott Greenhouse | Mount Holyoke College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Officially listed hours are Monday–Friday 9 a.m.–4 p.m. and Saturday–Sunday 1–4 p.m.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gettell-amphitheater","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Richard Glenn Gettell Amphitheater","title":"Find the Gettell Amphitheater","subtitle":"Campus amphitheater","notes":"Use the grassy seating as a landmark during major college gatherings, and check the events calendar when Convocation or other programming is scheduled.","short_summary":"An outdoor amphitheat